// ============================================================
// REFERENCE SNAPSHOT — production's actual datasource config
// ============================================================
// This is NOT part of the build and is never loaded by Prisma. It exists
// purely as a documented record of what the `datasource db { ... }` block
// in prisma/schema.prisma actually says on the live VPS right now.
//
// Why this file exists: the VPS's schema.prisma has this block swapped to
// MySQL (per README "Moving to MySQL"), but that swap has only ever been
// made directly on the server — it has never been committed to git. The
// committed prisma/schema.prisma still says `provider = "sqlite"` on
// purpose, so that a fresh `git clone` + local dev still works with zero
// setup (see CLAUDE.md — Local DB: SQLite). Do NOT copy this block over the
// real datasource block in schema.prisma; that would break local SQLite
// dev for the next person who pulls.
//
// Use this file only as the reference to restore from if the VPS is ever
// rebuilt from scratch: after cloning the repo there, manually apply the
// block below to prisma/schema.prisma (and set migration_lock.toml's
// `provider` to "mysql" — Prisma writes that automatically the next time
// `prisma migrate dev`/`deploy` runs against it, but it's worth knowing).
//
// Last confirmed against the live VPS (168.231.76.58): 2026-09-12.

datasource db {
  provider          = "mysql"
  url               = env("DATABASE_URL")
  shadowDatabaseUrl = env("SHADOW_DATABASE_URL")
}

// SHADOW_DATABASE_URL is required because `prisma migrate dev` (which the
// deploy flow runs directly on the VPS — see REVIEWS_REFERRALS_DEPLOY.md/
// CLAUDE.md deploy notes) needs a scratch database to compute schema diffs
// against MySQL. On the VPS this points at a second, empty database
// (`auramed_spa_shadow` alongside the real `auramed_spa`) on the same local
// MySQL server. Both DATABASE_URL and SHADOW_DATABASE_URL live in the VPS's
// /var/www/auramed-spa-platform/.env — not committed, same as any secret.
